<section id="compare" class="aq-section aq-section--alt aq-section--alt aq-levelling-sheet-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Comparing quotes on the same lines</h2><p class="aq-lead">Level every quote on these lines before you compare prices.</p></header><div class="aq-levelling-sheet" style="--ls-n:8"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__paper is-a" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__paper is-b" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__paper is-ours" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__h is-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>Line to level</span><span>Ask of every quote</span></p><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__h is-a" aria-hidden="true">Quote A</p><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__h is-b" aria-hidden="true">Quote B</p><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__h is-ours" aria-hidden="true">Where ours states it</p><ol class="aq-levelling-sheet__rows" role="list"><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="0"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Pretreatment</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Sized on your water analysis, or on an assumed feed?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#sys-pretreatment" data-wp="sys-pretreatment"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Pretreatment</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="1"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Storage and loop</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Tank volume, loop length and every point of use counted?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#sys-storage" data-wp="sys-storage"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Storage and distribution</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="2"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Instruments and controls</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Which readings are recorded, and is the code delivered unlocked?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#sys-monitoring" data-wp="sys-monitoring"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Monitoring and controls</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="3"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Documents</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Which documents, and who writes and signs each?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#cmp-documentation#index" data-wp="cmp-documentation#index"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Document index</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="4"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">FAT</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Run on water, to a protocol you approve first?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#svc-fat-sat" data-wp="svc-fat-sat"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">FAT and SAT</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="5"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">IQ and OQ</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Included, a priced option, or left to you?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#svc-cq" data-wp="svc-cq"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Commissioning and qualification</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="6"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">07</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Warranty start</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Counted from shipment, or from acceptance on your site?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-said" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#buying#terms" data-wp="buying#terms"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Terms at a glance</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-levelling-sheet__row" data-i="7"><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__line"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">08</span><h3 class="aq-levelling-sheet__t">Running cost</h3></div><p class="aq-levelling-sheet__ask"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Ask of every quote: </span>Per year, at your water and use, with the assumptions written?</p><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-a is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">A</span><i></i><i></i></span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-b is-gap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__q">B</span><i></i><i></i></span><div class="aq-levelling-sheet__c is-ours"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="aq-levelling-sheet__go" href="#svc-service#running-cost" data-wp="svc-service#running-cost"><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__k">Where ours states it: </span><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__gt">Running cost</span></a></div></li></ol><span class="aq-levelling-sheet__edge" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></div></div></section>
